NJnJmpxlwWdEJk7beI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSrWJaYcPVRFuQgzxVt7OHw1PFgXj5lGlp45cJtED8nnA&oe=6AF1D7CE"}, {"file_name": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa.png", "id": "1410222154351407", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293669_1410222157684740_1590916607050221838_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JHC0RgsyQNEQ7kNvwGvrlrT&_nc_oc=Adq2Tv74W-WLFzIulJOMsCuSlL4N1-u4rhhc8LiQ-yW-_bCqEgP2Y1FjfvCfYoznPvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSvUXMifwj6Ai3SZg4oARN7KBq5tD_cHKHZ9P80K63Dsg&oe=6AF1D925"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Downtown Racing: Drive Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to Downtown Racing: Drive Simulator, an immersive driving experience where speed, skill, and exploration come together. Cruise through a detailed downtown city filled with traffic, highways, intersections, and challenging roads. Choose from a variety of realistic sports cars, sedans, and supercars, each with unique handling and performance.\n\nComplete thrilling racing events, time trials, parking challenges, and driving missions to earn rewards and unlock new vehicles. Customize your cars with fresh paint, stylish rims, and performance upgrades to dominate every race.\n\nWhether you enjoy high-speed racing, realistic city driving, or simply exploring a beautiful urban environment, Downtown Racing: Drive Simulator delivers endless entertainment with smooth controls, stunning HD graphics, and dynamic gameplay.", "short_description": "Race through busy city streets, master realistic driving, and explore a vibrant open-world downtown. Complete exciting missions, unlock powerful cars, and become the ultimate driving champion."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fun-land-games/home/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publishe